+/*
+ * The frame, scaled to the panel by the GPU (boot-arg glscan=0: not). The frame is a texture of the library's own, of
+ * the iPhone's size; the panel is smaller, and the display driver used to scale it with the processor: 19 ms a frame,
+ * more than a refresh, so that frames came 30 a second (EXP-0125). Now the GPU scales it into a surface of the
